---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Investors & Off-Market | Diego Alvarado REALTOR®"
  description="Off-market and investor representation with Diego Alvarado across Flower Mound and North DFW."
>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container" style="max-width:42rem;">
    <p class="eyebrow">Investors</p>
    <h1>Off-market & investment focus</h1>
    <p>
      Diego came into real estate as an investor first. He helps you evaluate deals with
      comps, rents, and risk flags — including off-market opportunities when they fit.
    </p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;"><div class="container prose" style="max-width:42rem;">
    <h2>What “off-market” means here</h2>
    <p>
      Not every opportunity hits the public MLS first. Diego keeps a private list of
      sellers and investors open to quiet conversations. There is no live IDX feed on
      this site — matches happen person-to-person, then you move into a normal offer path.
    </p>
    <h2>Good fit if you want</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Buy-and-hold or light-value-add in the Flower Mound / North DFW belt</li>
      <li>A second set of eyes on rent, repairs, and exit assumptions</li>
      <li>Quiet outreach when the right property appears</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Talk off-market</a></p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
